# Layout Working Area Rules

- Keep the main app sidebar pinned to the far left of the viewport.
- Primary page content uses the full main pane width (sidebar to right edge).
- Do not add artificial max-width caps that leave unused gutters on wide screens.
- Prep desks and tool layouts may use multi-column grids inside the main pane.
- Preserve existing project visual tokens and component style language when adjusting layout.
